      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=ST045"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Historic Sanborn Fire Insurance Maps from 1908 to 1918 provide a visual record of early businesses in Stratford.",
